    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897900/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1754598397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897900/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1754598397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897900/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1754598397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In a world filled with Zombies, the last survivor of a Spec Ops squad tries to survive,<br>and make his way through Hordes of Zombies to reach his final destination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OVERVIEW</h2><br>Typing Hero is a Typing Zombie Survival Zombie Experience game.<br>Play in Handcrafted game levels utilizing stylized graphics. <br>Type as fast as you can and try to keep yourself alive for as much as possible.<br>Be fast and accurate with your typing to keep your combos high and increase the points that you earn.<br>Use the points that you earned to buy upgrades to die less and unlock new weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><br>Choose between 52 different heads and 30 different skins to customize your character.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897900/extras/9961fa78058bd2699ac4df7dfa2ef638.poster.avif?t=1754598397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897900/extras/9961fa78058bd2699ac4df7dfa2ef638.webm?t=1754598397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADES</h2><br>Upgrade your character by purchasing upgrades with the points that you earned during playing. Purchase Body armor to die harder and different weapons with unique upgrades of their own.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897900/extras/59f2c801c5ce36ddbdee71afb691f6b1.poster.avif?t=1754598397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897900/extras/59f2c801c5ce36ddbdee71afb691f6b1.webm?t=1754598397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 different difficulty levels to play with, a harder difficulty level awards more points.<br></li><li>A lot of Different Zombies to keep the game interesting.<br></li><li>10 Unique hand-crafted maps to play with utilizing stylized graphics.<br></li><li>Unique Bosses to make your life harder.<br></li><li>Statistics and Typing Statistics (Kills, Waves Survived, Combos, Time Survived, Wpm (Words Per Minute), Words Typed, Letters Typed, Total Errors, and more..)<br></li><li>Multiple Language Support for the UI (English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, Chinese, Greek)<br></li><li>Steam integrated - Keep your Score and Stats safe with your Steam profile.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Custom Dictionary<br></li><li>Color Blindness support <br></li><li>Hand Placement guide.</li></ul>",
