s to play with, a harder difficulty level awards more points.<br></li><li>A lot of Different Zombies to keep the game interesting.<br></li><li>10 Unique hand-crafted maps to play with utilizing stylized graphics.<br></li><li>Unique Bosses to make your life harder.<br></li><li>Statistics and Typing Statistics (Kills, Waves Survived, Combos, Time Survived, Wpm (Words Per Minute), Words Typed, Letters Typed, Total Errors, and more..)<br></li><li>Multiple Language Support for the UI (English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, Chinese, Greek)<br></li><li>Steam integrated - Keep your Score and Stats safe with your Steam profile.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Custom Dictionary<br></li><li>Color Blindness support <br></li><li>Hand Placement guide.</li></ul>",
